          <div class="mb-8">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">9.4 Spacing Classes</h2>
            <p class="mb-4">
              <strong>Definition:</strong> Spacing classes control padding, margin, and gap between elements.
            </p>
            <pre class="bg-gray-100 p-4 rounded-lg mb-4 overflow-x-auto">
                <code class="text-sm language-html">
