              <li><code class="text-sm bg-gray-100 p-1 rounded">mt-8</code>: Margin top of 2rem</li>
              <li><code class="text-sm bg-gray-100 p-1 rounded">space-y-4</code>: Vertical spacing between child elements</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

